<title>GERMANY: TABLE-BEIERSDORF SAYS H1 PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BEIERSDORF SAYS H1 PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   85.9    vs 140.4</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,237   vs 3,006</p>
<p>    Group investment			   95.9    vs 90.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German manufacturer of toiletries and cosmetics, medical products and adhesive tape is Beiersdorf AG.</p>
<p>The company also said that a restructuring of its Tesa adhesives division would burden 1997 net profit by 100 million marks and that it expected sales growth of between five and seven percent for 1997. Operating profit in 1997 was likely to be in line with the previous year, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
